{
 "track": "outlets_int",
 "title": "outlets_int (fix pass 2026-10-14): outlets in the game, 20 kits, planner/renderer fixes after the art + engineering critics",
 "header": [
  "Supersedes outlets_c1 and the 2026-10-14 16:24 outlets_int (backed up in W/outlet_fix/pkg_old). Report: Documentation/research/outlets/40_final.md.",
  "No approval needed: visual-owned files and new kit assets only. Fix pass changes (see 40_final.md section 2):",
  "  renderer: culling box = mesh bounds x matrix (conduit gaps 11.3 % -> 0); attachments cull with their box (15 m); WebGL gate also",
  "           FRONTROOMS_WEBGL_PREVIEW; metals -> Prop_AluminiumAnodised until P-4b; wall-match plates use the live wall material",
  "           with _FR_PlanarSnap (papered) or + _BumpScale 0 (painted); their screws keep an ivory finish",
  "  planner:  stage-2 desk power never through a wall; keep-outs for every fixture kind (foreign plates hidden in a neighbour keep-out);",
  "           one handy box + riser per Tall wall line; ground-up per wall line; jack plates follow the line (ivory on steel lines);",
  "           switches wear and sit at 1.12 m on printed walls (clear of the cue band); no thermoset blank on steel lines",
  "  Office kit: one pod base feed at the powered spine end (was two loose feeds)",
  "  shader:   FrontRoomsSurface.shader gains _FR_PlanarSnap (default 0: no material changes; per-draw block only). .meta kept",
  "  kits:     20 (Kit_OutletDuplex_Brown and Kit_OutletDuplex20_IG dropped: never referenced; brown/IG come from the palette)",
  "Touches (full list with sha1s in outlets_int_expected.txt):",
  "  add      Assets/Scripts/Office/FrontRoomsWallFixtures.cs / FrontRoomsWallFixtureSet.cs / FrontRoomsWallFixtureRenderer.cs (+ .meta,",
  "           GUIDs 14ab7ea1..., 6f896ecc..., e2a60678...; metas written first so an open Unity never mints its own)",
  "  add      20 kits Assets/Resources/Props/Models/Kit_Outlet*/Kit_Jack*/Kit_FloorBox*/Kit_Conduit*/Kit_CubiclePanel_Powered",
  "           (.fbx + .json + both .meta; LOD0 only, as main's kitlib builds them; metas first, sidecar before FBX)",
  "  replace  Assets/Resources/Rendering/FrontRoomsSurface.shader (+ _FR_PlanarSnap; .meta NOT touched)",
  "  replace  Tools/Blender/frontrooms_kit/assets/outlet_common.py (O1 plate field normals: <= 0.04 deg off the crown)",
  "  replace  Assets/Scripts/Office/FrontRoomsOfficeKit.cs (outlet hooks on the time-sliced dresser; powered spine panel; one pod feed; stage 2)",
  "  replace  Assets/Scripts/FrontRoomsRoomStream.cs (45 placeholder boxes with colliders out; StreamFaces + InstallLocal; one Exit sign as in main)",
  "NOT applied here: FrontRoomsMapWorld.cs (map contract: research/outlets/30_contract_map.md); outlets_lods (P-1, NEEDS APPROVAL);",
  "  the P-4b/P-6 RenderSetup proposal (NEEDS APPROVAL, data/40_rendersetup_patch.py.txt); Assets/Editor/OutletCensus/*.",
  "Never touches FrontRoomsMap/*, FrontRooms3DGame.cs, Editor/FrontRoomsMap/*, Assets/Levels or Library/."
 ],
